e a desire within them to find something that they cherish as well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_favorite_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_favorite_46","text":"Naturally, this will lead to them looking for something to fill that void.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_favorite_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_favorite_47","text":"All you need to do is provide them with something to fill said void, and observe the results.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_favorite_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_favorite_48","text":"In other words, your job is to give each of the Nikkes one of these dolls.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_favorite_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_favorite_49","text":"Then, you'll take good care of the one you have.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_favorite_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_favorite_50","text":"In doing so,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_favorite_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_favorite_51","text":"you'll be planting the notion of finding something to cherish in their hearts and minds.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_favorite_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_favorite_52","text":"There you have it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_favorite_53","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_favorite_53","text":"I think I understand what you're getting at,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_favorite_54","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_favorite_54","text":"but isn't it a bit strange for me to be giving everyone a doll of myself?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_favorite_55","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_favorite_55","text":"And for me to be cherishing a doll that's a copy of me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_favorite_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_favorite_56","text":"What do you mean? It's not strange at all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_favorite_57","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_favorite_57","text":"Yes, it is. It's completely bizarre.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_contents_favorite_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_SubScenario:d_contents_fa